  "description": "Framework for building plugins within the Dungeon Helper system. Dungeon Helper is a third party plugin system for use with Dungeons and Dragons Online.\n\nVoK.Sdk, Dungeon Helper, and their creators are not affiliated with Dungeons and Dragons Online or it's creators/operators, Standing Stone Games. Visit our discord for help and more information.\n\nAny version not listed here should not be used. Changelog dropped for versions prior to 4.0.0.\n\nIn 4.0.13\n* TBD\n\nIn 4.0.12\n* Support for OnAuctionList result\n* Enums updated to Update 71\n\nIn 4.0.7\n* Reverting breaking change in Plugin Initialize\n* Update 69.2 enums\n* Fixes in Waveform Properties\n* Parsing of MaterialModifier Objects\n* Parsing of RenderMaterial Objects\n* Parsing of RenderTexture Objects\n* Updated MaterialInstance documentation\n* New RawImage export of the image as it sits in dat files, unprocessed\n* Fixes in RenderMesh names and structures\n* New Load methods for Setups and RenderMeshes\n* Parsing of VisualDesc objects\n* Update 69.1 enums",
